# Team orienteering problem, Chao instances. The objective is minus the total profit.
# Tip: after a batch execution, call 'grep statistics: out/chao.out -h | cut -c13-' to get the results as rows for a LaTeX table.
# julia src/run.jl -b chao.batch &> out/chao.out
